{"book":"john","num":1,"verses":[{"en":"In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God.","n":1,"sm":"Upu Sa i le amataga, le Upu, sa i le Atua le Upu, o le Atua foi le Upu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Upu"},{"en":"","sm":"Sa"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amataga,"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Upu,"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Upu,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Upu."}]},{"en":"The same was in the beginning with God.","n":2,"sm":"O ia lava sa ile Atua i le amataga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"ile"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amataga."}]},{"en":"All things were made by him; and without him was not any thing made that was made.","n":3,"sm":"Na ia faia mea uma lava; e leai foi se mea e tasi na faia e lei faia e ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Na"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"lava;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lei"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"In him was life; and the life was the light of men.","n":4,"sm":"Sa ia te ia le ola; o le ola foi o le malamalama lea o tagata.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Sa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ola;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ola"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"malamalama"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata."}]},{"en":"And the light